WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.417
See your Codex usage at a glance. Recent conversations, input and output tokens, and your remaining allowance, in one small window.

2
00:00:10.417 --> 00:00:20.105
Want a closer look? Expand a conversation to see usage by model. The window grows with the details, then shrinks back.

3
00:00:20.105 --> 00:00:29.150
Need more room? Tuck the window into your menu bar or system tray. Bring it back whenever you need it.
